        </p>

    </div>


    <!-- HTML -->

    <div class="tutorial-card html-card">

        <div class="tutorial-info">

            <h2>HTML</h2>

            <p>The language for building web pages</p>

            <div class="card-buttons">
                <a href="#" class="green-btn">Learn HTML</a>
                <a href="#" class="white-btn">HTML Reference</a>
            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="code-example">

            <h3>HTML Example:</h3>

            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
&lt;title&gt;HTML Tutorial&lt;/title&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;

&lt;body&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;This is a heading&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is a paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>

            <button class="try-btn">Try it Yourself »</button>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- CSS -->

    <div class="tutorial-card css-card">

        <div class="tutorial-info">

            <h2>CSS</h2>

            <p>The language for styling web pages</p>

            <div class="card-buttons">
                <a href="#" class="green-btn">Learn CSS</a>
                <a href="#" class="white-btn">CSS Reference</a>
            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="code-example">

            <h3>CSS Example:</h3>

            <pre><code>body {
    background-color: lightblue;
}

h1 {
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
}

p {
    font-family: Arial;
}</code></pre>

            <button class="try-btn">Try it Yourself »</button>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- JAVASCRIPT -->

    <div class="tutorial-card js-card">

        <div class="tutorial-info">

            <h2>JavaScript</h2>

            <p>The language for programming web pages</p>

            <div class="card-buttons">
                <a href="#" class="green-btn">Learn JavaScript</a>
                <a href="#" class="white-btn">JS Reference</a>
            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="code-example">

            <h3>JavaScript Example:</h3>

            <pre><code>&lt;button onclick="myFunction()"&gt;
Click Me
&lt;/button&gt;

&lt;script&gt;

function myFunction() {
    alert("Hello World!");
}

&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>

            <button class="try-btn">Try it Yourself »</button>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- PYTHON -->

    <div class="tutorial-card python-card">

        <div class="tutorial-info">

            <h2>Python</h2>

            <p>A popular programming language</p>

            <div class="card-buttons">
                <a href="#" class="green-btn">Learn Python</a>
                <a href="#" class="white-btn">Python Reference</a>
            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="code-example">

            <h3>Python Example:</h3>

            <pre><code>if 5 > 2:
    print("Five is greater than two!")</code></pre>

            <button class="try-btn">Try it Yourself »</button>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- SQL -->

    <div class="tutorial-card sql-card">

        <div class="tutorial-info">

            <h2>SQL</h2>

            <p>A language for accessing databases</p>

            <div class="card-buttons">
                <a href="#" class="green-btn">Learn SQL</a>
